### 1D.3 Staff — Login — Public — ⭐ RETURNS TOKEN (save as {{staffToken}})
# POST /api/staff/login — pending 403, rejected 403, expired suspension auto-clear, active suspension 403, cleanup ended assignments.
# Body: { "email", "password" } -> jwt { staff_id, role:"staff" }
