# GET /api/patients/staff-required — public, no token — Expected 200: { staff_required: true } or { staff_required: false }
# Logic: NOT EXISTS global available staff (shobi unavailable) AND EXISTS approved+active doctor with NO ACTIVE assignment
# Global e 1 jon o available thakle → false → banner hidden (assign korar moto staff ase, ad na)
# Cases: A global 1 available → false (hidden), B global 0 + doctor without staff → true (visible), C later staff approved → false, D multi + global 0 → true, E all have staff OR global 1 → false
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/staff-required

