#  6) 3D.2 window -> 3D.4 create schedule (only 12:55-18:00 Asia/Dhaka, tomorrow..Dec31) -> 3D.3 list
#  7) 1C.1 patient register -> 1C.2 login -> set @patientToken
#  8) 5.13 create appointment (needs schedule_id from doctor) -> 4.7/4.8 staff approve -> 5.16 payment -> 3.7 prescription
#  9) 8.1 check notifications for patient/doctor/admin
